The KalaReach qualified PSReadLine package
==========================================

This package rebuilds no shell and copies no upstream source. It is a PowerShell module of Kala
Powered's own, which binds into the PSReadLine the person already has, and it is distributed under
the BSD 3-Clause Licence in the repository root like the rest of the crates, scripts and
documentation.

Nothing of PowerShell's or PSReadLine's source is copied, patched or redistributed here, so this
directory carries no upstream licence of its own. The module calls PSReadLine's published API and
wraps the handlers the person has bound; it replaces neither.
